{"id": 997071, "slug": "double-shoulders", "name": "Double Shoulders", "name_original": "Double Shoulders", "description": "<p>“Two children are confronted with the harsh reality of the place they have just arrived in. They have no choice but to try to escape. Faced with obstacles, their best hope lies in mutual support. Will they make it through a journey that will bring them closer together, reveal secrets as mysterious as they are terrifying, and, above all, save them from a grim fate?”</p><p><strong>ESCAPE WITH YOUR NEWFOUND COMPANION</strong></p><p>Play as Lois and Sam, two unlikely friends who must work together to escape this twisted place.</p><p><strong>HUMANOIDS DEFORMED TO ADAPT TO THEIR GRIM LABOR</strong></p><p>Be careful, you’re not alone. Strange monstrosities lurk in this place. They were once human like you, but this place changed them. Now, they’re merely shadows of what they once were, and they won’t hesitate to put you back in line. Don’t get caught, or you might end up like them.</p><p><strong>WITHIN A DARK AND DEADLY ENVIRONMENT HIDING A HEAVY SECRET</strong></p><p>Traverse the facility and explore a variety of environments. Each one presents its own unique challenges and dangers.</p><p><strong>WILL YOU ESCAPE THIS PLACE, OR END UP LIKE THE OTHERS ?</strong></p>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2025-01-31", "tba": false, "updated": "2026-06-07T12:27:31", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/4f2/4f224b59ab8402c7a1df9e3ff4c632f9.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/443/443e7e2c7de5fb26171c19ca071741d8.jpg", "website": "", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 0, "ratings": [{"id": 3, "title": "meh", "count": 2, "percent": 100.0}], "reactions": null, "added": 6, "added_by_status": {"owned": 2, "beaten": 3, "toplay": 1}, "playtime": 0, "screenshots_count": 6, "movies_count": 0, "creators_count": 0, "achievements_count": 0, "parent_achievements_count": 0, "reddit_ur